<title>UK: FTSE 100 hits new record in post-budget rally.</title>
<headline>FTSE 100 hits new record in post-budget rally.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's FTSE 100 share index on Thursday reversed early losses and surged to a new all-time high in the wake of Wednesday's budget from the new Labour government.</p>
<p>The index traded 52.3 points up to 4,803.7 by 1016 GMT after a previous high of 4,796, hit on June 13.</p>
